{"code":0,"data":{"title":"消息推送","content":"<h1 id=\"s-hzilqaxw\">请求体结构说明</h1><h2 id=\"s-wxoviq5j\">接口原型</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"114\" style=\"width: 114px\"><p><strong>承载协议</strong></p></th><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"519\" style=\"width: 519px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>HTTPS POST</p></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"114\" style=\"width: 114px\"><p><strong>接口URL</strong></p></th><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"519\" style=\"width: 519px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>/v1/projects/{appId}/messages:send</p><ul><li><p>说明：{appId}请替换为您应用的id</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"114\" style=\"width: 114px\"><p><strong>编码方式</strong></p></th><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"519\" style=\"width: 519px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Utf-8</p></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"114\" style=\"width: 114px\"><p><strong>数据格式</strong></p></th><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"519\" style=\"width: 519px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Content-Type: application/json</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-n0ygwstt\"><strong>Request Header</strong></h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"140\" style=\"width: 140px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"388\" style=\"width: 388px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"445\" style=\"width: 445px\"><p><strong>样例</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"140\" style=\"width: 140px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Authorization</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"388\" style=\"width: 388px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Authorization: Bearer &lt;valid Oauth 2.0 token&gt;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"445\" style=\"width: 445px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Authorization: Bearer ya29.El******Ri_Uz...HnS_uNreA&nbsp;</p><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"140\" style=\"width: 140px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>message-type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"388\" style=\"width: 388px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>消息类型，取值如下：</p><p>3：VoIP Service Kit 应用内通话</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"445\" style=\"width: 445px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-02yzt1v2\"><strong>Request Body</strong></h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"146\" style=\"width: 146px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>是否必选</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"274\" style=\"width: 274px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"146\" style=\"width: 146px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>message</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"274\" style=\"width: 274px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>要发送的消息</p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/979#s-4j9cl213\">VoIP Service Kit</a></p></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"146\" style=\"width: 146px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>options</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"274\" style=\"width: 274px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/979#s-lkxo6vzl\">消息属性</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"146\" style=\"width: 146px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>target</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"274\" style=\"width: 274px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/979#s-yyru88tm\">消息推送的目标用户</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 id=\"s-7ecqw7f8\"><br><br>请求体参数说明</h1><h2 id=\"s-4j9cl213\">VoIP Service Kit <strong>Message</strong></h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>是否必选</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"588\" style=\"width: 588px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>extraData</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"588\" style=\"width: 588px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>VoIP Service Kit 通话自定义消息负载，内容为字符串格式，样例：\"extra data\"，消息送达后会将该内容回调同步给app内，具体回调方法和参数请参考<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/967#s-ehyui77r\">push sdk说明文档</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-lkxo6vzl\"><strong>options</strong></h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\"><p><strong>是否必选</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"612\" style=\"width: 612px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>ttl</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"612\" style=\"width: 612px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>离线消息缓存时长，单位：秒</p><p>最大：30s</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>collapseKey</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"612\" style=\"width: 612px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>用户设备离线时，Push服务器对离线消息缓存机制的控制方式，用户设备上线后缓存消息会再次下发，取值如下：</p><p>0：对所有离线消息都缓存（当离线消息超过30条时，丢弃老消息，保留最新消息，默认值）</p><p>-1：对每个应用发送到该用户设备的离线消息只会缓存最新的一条</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appMessageId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"612\" style=\"width: 612px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>消息唯一标识，App开发者自定义消息Id，主要用于消息去重，去重时间为10分钟</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>callBackId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"612\" style=\"width: 612px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>回执id</p><p>开通回执权益后，在控制台手动添加回执地址后获得</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>callBackParam</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"612\" style=\"width: 612px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>回执参数</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-yyru88tm\"><strong>target</strong></h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>是否必选</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"588\" style=\"width: 588px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>token</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>必须</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>List&lt;String&gt;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"588\" style=\"width: 588px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用注册的token，支持批量单推</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 id=\"s-kbzqsenz\"><br>请求示例</h1><pre><code>{\n  \"message\": {\n    \"extraData\": \"abc\"\n  },\n  \"options\": {\n    \"ttl\": 3600,\n    \"appMessageId\": \"abc123\",\n    \"collapseKey\": -1,\n    \"callBackId\": \"1\",\n    \"callBackParam\": \"abc\",\n    \"extensionExpireShow\": true\n  },\n  \"target\": {\n    \"token\": [\n      \"v2-CRqymX-X_PA_******eUrTz4Eamaj2VrpGPGPoWxH5AmnVX5sl4\"\n    ]\n  }\n}</code></pre><h1 id=\"s-vsk6pkv9\"><br>响应参数</h1><h2 id=\"s-zkbqadj0\"><strong>Response Body</strong></h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"236\" style=\"width: 236px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>name</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"236\" style=\"width: 236px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>消息id</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-1urci5su\">响应示例</h2><pre><code>{\n    \"message\": {\n        \"name\": \"2273129511576669441\"\n    }\n}</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-up6annpl\">响应码</h2><p>接口响应码与HTTP请求状态码一致</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\"><p>响应码</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\"><p>描述</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\"><p>解决方法</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>200</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>OK</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>无</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>400</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Bad Request</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>检查请求格式、参数等是否正常</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>401</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Unauthorized</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1、确认请求头中是否包含Authorization, 缺失则需调用【授权码获取】接口获取正确的Authorization</p><p>2、Authorization使用错误, 不是鉴权接口返回的Authorization</p><p>3、Authorization过期失效, Authorization有效期默认为1天，过期后无法使用</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>404</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Not Found</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>资源未找到</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>405</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Method Not Allowed</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求的HTTP方法不支持，请调整</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>409</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>AppMessageId Conflict</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>设置的appMessageId冲突</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>413</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Payload Too Large</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求体超限</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>415</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Unsupported Media Type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求类型不支持</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>429</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Too Many Requests</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口速度超过阈值</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>500</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"239\" style=\"width: 239px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Internal Server Error</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"660\" style=\"width: 660px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>系统运行的未知异常</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>","versionCode":4,"updateTime":1782877065000,"breadCrumbs":"vivo推送,推送技术文档,「全新」服务端API接口文档,消息推送","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}